nce.\n[−6]: You get an emblem with "If you control a creature, damage that would reduce your life total to less than 1 reduces it to 1 instead."', '{1}{W}, Exile Trustworthy Scout from your graveyard: Search your library for a card named Trustworthy Scout, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{3}{G}{G}, Exile Mother Bear from your graveyard: Create two 2/2 green Bear creature tokens. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{4}, {T}: Create a 2/2 colorless Shapeshifter creature token with changeling. (It has every creature type.)', "{4}{S}{S}: Monstrosity 2. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put two +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous. {S} can be paid with one mana from a snow source.)\nAs long as Chillerpillar is monstrous, it has flying.", "{B}: Endling gains menace until end of turn.\n{B}: Endling gains deathtouch until end of turn.\n{B}: Endling gains undying until end of turn. (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)\n{1}: Endling gets +1/-1 or -1/+1 until end of turn.", '{R}: You may put a planeswalker card from your hand onto the battlefield. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.', '{S}: Frostwalla gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn. ({S} can be paid with one mana from a snow source.)', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Prismatic Vista: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {B} or {G}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Nurturing Peatland: Draw a card.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {G} or {U}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Waterlogged Grove: Draw a card.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {R} or {W}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Sunbaked Canyon: Draw a card.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {U} or {R}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Fiery Islet: Draw a card.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {W} or {B}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Silent Clearing: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\n{3}: Fountain of Ichor becomes a 3/3 Dinosaur artifact creature until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifice Cave of Temptation: Put two +1/+1 counters on target creature. Activate only as a sorcery.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}{S}: Until end of turn, Frostwalk Bastion becomes a 2/3 Construct artifact creature. It's still a land. ({S} can be paid with one mana from a snow source.)\nWhenever Frostwalk Bastion deals combat damage to a creature, tap that creature and it doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}{W}, {T}: Put target enchantment card from your graveyard on top of your library.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Talisman of Resilience deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}. Talisman of Curiosity deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}. Talisman of Conviction deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}. Talisman of Creativity deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}. Talisman of Hierarchy deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {G}{G}{G}.', '{T}: Another target creature you control gains protection from colorless or from the color of your choice until end of turn.', '{T}: Tap target creature. Activate only if you had a creature enter the battlefield under your control this turn.', '{T}: Untap another target snow permanent.', '{X}: Crypt Rats deals X damage to each creature and each player. Spend only black mana on X.']
